sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Router
    participant P as Primary Node
    participant S as Replica Node
    C->>R: PUT key,value,ttl
    R->>P: route write
    P->>P: persist in-memory
    P->>S: replicate async/sync
    S-->>P: ack
    P-->>R: write success
    R-->>C: 200 OK
